#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Using lex\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"using-lex\">lexの利用</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lexicon schemas enable code generation with types and validation. Our SDKs each install a `lex` tool that lets you generate a type-safe client that knows which parameters each AT endpoint expects.\n"
msgstr "Lexiconスキーマは、型と検証を備えたコード生成を実現します。SDKには、各ATエンドポイントが期待するパラメータを知っている型安全なクライアントを生成できる`lex`ツールがインストールされています。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "## TypeScript\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"typescript\">TypeScript</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, install the `@atproto/lex` package:\n"
msgstr "まず、`@atproto/lex`パッケージをインストールします。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"npm install -g @atproto/lex\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"npm install -g @atproto/lex\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "This provides the `lex` command, which you can use to install Lexicons into a local project:\n"
msgstr "これにより`lex`コマンドが提供され、ローカルプロジェクトにLexiconをインストールできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"lex install app.bsky.feed.post app.bsky.feed.like\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"lex install app.bsky.feed.post app.bsky.feed.like\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "This creates:\n"
msgstr "これにより以下が作成されます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- `lexicons.json` - manifest tracking installed Lexicons and their versions (CIDs)\n"
"- `lexicons/` - directory containing the Lexicon JSON files\n"
msgstr ""
"- `lexicons.json` - インストールされたLexiconとそのバージョン（CID）を追跡するマニフェスト\n"
"- `lexicons/` - Lexicon JSONファイルを含むディレクトリ\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Finally, generate TypeScript schemas from the installed Lexicons:\n"
msgstr "最後に、インストールされたLexiconからTypeScriptスキーマを生成します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"lex build\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"lex build\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "This generates TypeScript files in `./src/lexicons`. Now, you'll have these functions available to use in your code:\n"
msgstr "これにより`./src/lexicons`にTypeScriptファイルが生成されます。これで、コードでこれらの関数が利用可能になります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```tsx\n"
"import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"import * as app from './lexicons/app.js'\n"
msgstr ""
"```tsx\n"
"import { Client } from '@atproto/lex'\n"
"import * as app from './lexicons/app.js'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Create an unauthenticated client instance\n"
"const client = new Client('https://public.api.bsky.app')\n"
msgstr ""
"// 認証無しのクライアントインスタンスを作成\n"
"const client = new Client('https://public.api.bsky.app')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:49
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"// Start making requests using generated schemas\n"
"const response = await client.call(app.bsky.actor.getProfile, {\n"
"  actor: 'pfrazee.com',\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"// 生成されたスキーマを使用してリクエストの作成を開始する\n"
"const response = await client.call(app.bsky.actor.getProfile, {\n"
"  actor: 'pfrazee.com',\n"
"})\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/installing-lexicons/en.mdx:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more guidance on working with `lex`, refer to the [readme](https://github.com/bluesky-social/atproto-internal/blob/msi/lex/packages/lex/lex/README.md#json-schemas).\n"
msgstr "`lex`の使用方法に関する詳細については、[readme](https://github.com/bluesky-social/atproto-internal/blob/msi/lex/packages/lex/lex/README.md#json-schemas)を参照してください。\n"

